d the S-runs seem to span two rows each.\n\nThat works if \"S\" counts as two rows: L,R,R,SS,SS and R,R,R,SS,SS both equal 7. But I realize I don't actually have the test input in front of me yet \u2014 I still need to locate it before applying this pattern.\n\n",
